NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools provides you with an easy-to-use and modular client that allows you to compose multiple devtools into one easy-to-use panel."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the "},{"type":"link","href":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/angular-devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" library. This will install the devtools core as well as provide you with the Angular-specific adapter."}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm i @tanstack/angular-devtools","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next, in the root of your application, import the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtoolsComponent"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/angular-devtools"},{"type":"text","value":" and add it to your template."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtoolsComponent } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtools],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools />\n  `,\n})\nexport class App {}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Import the desired devtools and provide them to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" via the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"[plugins]"},{"type":"text","value":" input along with a label for the menu."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport type { TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport { AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/angular-query-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtools],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools [plugins]=\"plugins\" />\n  `,\n})\nexport class AppComponent {\n  plugins: Array<TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin> = [\n    {\n      name: 'Angular Query',\n      render: AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel,\n    },\n  ]\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Finally, add any additional configuration you desire to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":". More information can be found under the "},{"type":"link","href":"../../configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools Configuration"}]},{"type":"text","value":" section."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"setup","text":"Setup","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Devtools provides you with an easy-to-use and modular client that allows you to compose multiple devtools into one easy-to-use panel.\n\n## Setup\n\nInstall the [TanStack Devtools](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/angular-devtools) library. This will install the devtools core as well as provide you with the Angular-specific adapter.\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/angular-devtools\n```\n\nNext, in the root of your application, import the `TanStackDevtoolsComponent` from `@tanstack/angular-devtools` and add it to your template.\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtoolsComponent } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtools],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools />\n  `,\n})\nexport class App {}\n```\n\nImport the desired devtools and provide them to the `TanStackDevtools` via the `[plugins]` input along with a label for the menu.\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport type { TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport { AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/angular-query-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtools],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools [plugins]=\"plugins\" />\n  `,\n})\nexport class AppComponent {\n  plugins: Array<TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin> = [\n    {\n      name: 'Angular Query',\n      render: AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel,\n    },\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nFinally, add any additional configuration you desire to the `TanStackDevtools`. More information can be found under the [TanStack Devtools Configuration](../../configuration) section.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Basic setup\nid: basic-setup\n---\n\nTanStack Devtools provides you with an easy-to-use and modular client that allows you to compose multiple devtools into one easy-to-use panel.\n\n## Setup\n\nInstall the [TanStack Devtools](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/angular-devtools) library. This will install the devtools core as well as provide you with the Angular-specific adapter.\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/angular-devtools\n```\n\nNext, in the root of your application, import the `TanStackDevtoolsComponent` from `@tanstack/angular-devtools` and add it to your template.\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtoolsComponent } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtools],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools />\n  `,\n})\nexport class App {}\n```\n\nImport the desired devtools and provide them to the `TanStackDevtools` via the `[plugins]` input along with a label for the menu.\n\n```typescript\nimport { Component } from '@angular/core'\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport type { TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin } from '@tanstack/angular-devtools'\nimport { AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/angular-query-devtools'\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-root',\n  standalone: true,\n  imports: [TanStackDevtools],\n  template: `\n    <app-content />\n    <tanstack-devtools [plugins]=\"plugins\" />\n  `,\n})\nexport class AppComponent {\n  plugins: Array<TanStackDevtoolsAngularPlugin> = [\n    {\n      name: 'Angular Query',\n      render: AngularQueryDevtoolsPanel,\n    },\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nFinally, add any additional configuration you desire to the `TanStackDevtools`. More information can be found under the [TanStack Devtools Configuration](../../configuration) section.\n"}
